  "source": "canonical.written_solution",
  "target_status": "source_written",
  "target_text": "For every gray endpoint, follow each cardinal direction through a contiguous red bar to the first black pivot. Count the contiguous red tail beyond that pivot, erase it to the field color 7, and redraw the same-length tail perpendicular from the pivot toward the grid center. Preserve the endpoint, bar, and pivot. On an exact center-line tie, turn up or left."
